    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Gold Rush - is the simplest 2D game in which you have to overcome various traps and look for treasures.<br>The essence of this game is very simple. Your main task is to explore a variety of locations and find the right treasures. But don't think that everything will be very easy. On your way there will be a huge variety of traps that you will have to overcome. Think over your every step and every action and this game will definitely not make you bored!</strong><br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong><br><br>- Large locations.<br>- Interesting and simple gameplay.<br>- Beautiful graphics.<br>- Unforgettable atmosphere.",
